Run the following fwts tests to get information about the machine


 fwts acpiinfo bios_info dmicheck mcfg cmosdump crsdump ebdadump memmapdump mpdump --results-output=biosinfo.log
 fwts romdump --results-output=romdump.log
 fwts uefidump --results-output=uefidump.log
 fwts uefivarinfo --results-output=uefivarinfo.log

 fwts --dump 

kernel dmesg checks (run last)
 fwts klog oops --results-output=kernelinfo.log

1) https://wiki.ubuntu.com/Kernel/Reference/fwts
